Package: shai-installer
Version: 0.1.2
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Aabey LLC <info@aabeyllc.com>
Depends: apt, bash, coreutils, dconf-cli, grep, libglib2.0-bin, python3, sed, systemd, util-linux
Description: Guided SHAI appliance configuration for Ubuntu Desktop
 SHAI means Smart Home Automation and AI. This checkpoint-test installer
 assesses an existing Ubuntu Desktop installation, previews exact validated
 debloat operations, requires explicit approval, applies manual-update and
 proxy-based Web Offline policy,
 and records health evidence. Ubuntu remains the operating system.
